
# portfolio

## loading
- the initial portfolio loader begins closing after 1600 milliseconds regardless of image preload completion @spec @implemented
- portfolio images preload from the smallest responsive tier to larger tiers and unfinished work continues after the loader closes @implemented
- the fixed loader window prioritizes smallest thumbnails while larger preload tiers use limited background concurrency to avoid blocking hover frames @implemented

## interaction
- portfolio hover samples the project title under the pointer on every animation frame and enqueues every crossed project in traversal order @spec @implemented
- project title hover feedback and preview images advance by one queued project per rendered frame without transition animation @spec @implemented

## images
- portfolio list previews use the smallest responsive thumbnail while detail views request larger sources at high priority @implemented
- while the portfolio list is open, every crossed project receives one rendered frame with its decoded 300-pixel thumbnail before the queue advances @spec @implemented
